error.description:
Stable machine-readable error code. Meanings: `invalid_shape` (malformed body);
`identity_mismatch` (a body `customer_id` disagrees with your token); `reserved_identity`
(this identity can never map to an Odoo); `destination_conflict` (that Odoo destination is
already registered); `onboarding_in_progress` (a registration for you is already running);
`connection_failed` (the live connection test failed); `invalid_fk` (a stage/team/user id
does not exist in your Odoo); `unsafe_url` (`odoo_url` resolves to a non-public address);
`url_validation_timeout` (host validation timed out, fail-closed); `not_found` (no connection
registered); `registry_unavailable` (onboarding not configured on this deployment);
`registry_degraded` (backend temporarily unreachable — retryable).

retryable.description:
Present and `true` on a `registry_degraded` 503 — the tenant-registry backend is
temporarily unreachable (bounded off-loop call timed out). Safe to retry with backoff;
the response also carries a `Retry-After` header. Absent on non-retryable errors.
